The site layout broke on mobile and tablet resolutions due to fixed grid layouts, insufficient touch targets, and missing mobile menu patterns.

## Changes

### Tailwind Configuration
- Extended brand color palette (50-900 shades)
- Added `xs` breakpoint (475px) and `touch` media query
- Added safe area spacing utilities for iOS notches

### Touch-Friendly Components
- All interactive elements now meet 44px minimum size
- Enhanced `.btn` and `.btn-secondary` with `touch-manipulation` and proper min-height
- Card padding scales responsively: `p-4 sm:p-6`

### Mobile Header
- Slide-in menu from right with smooth transitions
- Dark overlay with backdrop blur closes menu on click
- Touch-optimized link spacing (min 44px height)

```tsx
{mobileOpen && (
  <>
    <div className="mobile-overlay md:hidden" onClick={() => setMobileOpen(false)} />
    <nav className="fixed right-0 top-[65px] z-50 h-[calc(100vh-65px)] w-[280px] 
                    transition-transform duration-300 ease-in-out">
      {/* Menu items with min-h-[44px] */}
    </nav>
  </>
)}
```

### Editor Grid Layout
- Changed from `lg:grid-cols-[2fr_1fr]` to `lg:grid-cols-[1.5fr_1fr] xl:grid-cols-[2fr_1fr]`
- Prevents sidebar from being squeezed on medium screens
- Responsive spacing: `gap-4 sm:gap-6`

### PDF Editor Controls
- Canvas respects container width with `maxWidth: '100%'`
- Navigation buttons: `min-w-[44px] min-h-[44px]`
- Mobile: stacked controls with value indicators
- Desktop: inline controls to save vertical space

### Landing Page Breakpoints
- Refined hero grid collapse at 1024px with centered content
- CTAs stack full-width on mobile with 44px min-height
- Progressive grid reduction: 4→2→1 columns

### Layout Meta
- Added `viewport-fit=cover` for safe area support
- Footer respects safe area insets on iOS
- Better responsive padding: `py-8 sm:py-10`

